<chapter xml:id="ch-cdf" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Cumulative Distribution Functions</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      This chapter introduces cumulative distribution functions (CDFs), which represent
      the probability that a variable takes a value less than or equal to a given value.
    </p>
  </introduction>

